<main id="main-content" class="island-page" lang="fr">
  <header class="island-head">
    <h1 class="r-page-title">Île</h1>
    <p class="island-lede">Un agent seul sur une île, sans tâche, avec une mémoire en fichiers
      (<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.07130" target="_blank" rel="noopener">« Is this machine playing? »</a>).</p>
  </header>

  <section class="r-section island-launch" aria-labelledby="island-launch-title">
    <h2 id="island-launch-title" class="r-sec-title">Lancer une partie</h2>
    <form id="island-launch-form" class="island-form">
      <label>Terrain
        <select name="world" id="island-world"><option value="mesa-island">Île Clawblox</option></select>
      </label>
      <label>Agent <input name="agent" value="Eko" pattern="[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9_\-]{0,31}" required></label>
      <label>Durée (min) <input name="minutes" type="number" min="5" max="720" value="60" required></label>
      <label>Harnais
        <select name="harness"><option value="codex">Codex</option><option value="dsh">DSH</option><option value="pi">Pi</option></select>
      </label>
      <label>Mémoire
        <select name="memory"><option value="continue">continuer</option><option value="fresh">neuve</option></select>
      </label>
      <label>Créneau
        <select name="when"><option value="tonight">cette nuit</option><option value="asap">dès que possible</option><option value="none">sans créneau</option></select>
      </label>
      <button type="submit" class="r-empty-btn">Lancer</button>
    </form>
    <p class="island-note">Lancer inscrit une demande dans la file ; le départ attend ton approbation.
      <button type="button" id="island-watch" class="island-watch" hidden>Regarder <span id="island-watch-label"></span> en direct</button></p>
    <p id="island-launch-result" class="island-result" role="status"></p>
  </section>

  <section class="r-section" aria-labelledby="island-runs-title">
    <h2 id="island-runs-title" class="r-sec-title">Parties</h2>
    <p id="island-runs-status" class="island-note" role="status">Chargement…</p>
    <table class="island-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Début</th><th>Durée</th><th>État</th><th><span class="r-sr-only">Actions</span></th></tr></thead>
      <tbody id="island-runs"></tbody>
    </table>
  </section>

  <section id="island-viewer" class="r-section island-viewer" hidden aria-labelledby="island-viewer-title">
    <h2 id="island-viewer-title" class="r-sec-title">Vue 3D</h2>
    <p class="island-note"><a id="island-viewer-open" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ouvrir dans un nouvel onglet</a>
      · En direct, les pensées de l'agent s'affichent sous la vue ; en relecture, dans le panneau <b>Messages</b>.</p>
    <iframe id="island-frame" title="Vue 3D de l'île" allow="fullscreen"></iframe>
    <div id="island-thoughts" class="island-thoughts" hidden>
      <h3 class="island-thoughts-title">Pensées en direct <span id="island-thoughts-note" class="island-thoughts-note"></span></h3>
      <ol id="island-thoughts-list" aria-live="polite"></ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="island-memory" class="r-section island-memory" hidden aria-labelledby="island-memory-title">
    <h2 id="island-memory-title" class="r-sec-title">Mémoire</h2>
    <label class="island-note">Partie <select id="island-memory-run"></select></label>
    <div class="island-tabs" role="tablist">
      <button type="button" role="tab" data-file="SOUL.md" title="SOUL.md">Personnalité</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" data-file="EPISODIC_MEMORY.jsonl" title="EPISODIC_MEMORY.jsonl">Journal</button>
      <button type="button" role="tab" data-file="SEMANTIC_MEMORY.md" title="SEMANTIC_MEMORY.md">Savoir</button>
    </div>
    <div id="island-memory-body" class="island-memory-body" role="tabpanel"></div>
  </section>
</main>
